<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">InterleaveThinker: 
<br class="ltx_break">Reinforcing Agentic Interleaved Generation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="id1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dian Zheng<sup id="id1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,2</span></sup><sup id="id1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">*</span></sup></span>
