<div id="p3" class="ltx_para"><img src="2606.13679v1/teaser.png" id="g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:467/332;" width="467" height="332" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
